  lex_splices_err_space_comment.pcpp - break step of lex_splices.pcpp:
  the same in a // comment (LX0201, a warning, at the backslash)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\lex_splices_err_space_comment.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\lex_splices_err_space_comment.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that warning; nothing else is reported.
